@startuml
title PIPE — Manage Recruitment Stages

skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Recruiter / Admin" as Recruiter
boundary "Job Stages UI" as UI
control "Spring Security" as Security
control "TenantWebInterceptor" as Interceptor
boundary "RecruitmentStageController" as Controller
control "RecruitmentStageService" as Service
database "Tenant DB (MySQL)" as TenantDB

note over Recruiter, Security
  Preconditions: tenant ACTIVE; caller can manage the job;
  job already has a pipeline (from apply-template or seed).
  System stages: APPLIED, SCREENING, ASSESSMENT, INTERVIEW, OFFER, HIRED, REJECTED.
end note

Recruiter -> UI: Open stage manager for the job
activate UI
UI -> Security: GET /api/v1/jobs/{jobId}/stages
activate Security
Security -> Interceptor: Forward after RBAC
activate Interceptor
deactivate Security
Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: list(jobId)
activate Service
Service -> TenantDB: findByJobIdOrderBySortOrder
activate TenantDB
TenantDB --> Service: Stage list
deactivate TenantDB
Service --> Controller: StageResponse[*]
deactivate Service
Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller
UI --> Recruiter: Show system and custom columns
Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
deactivate Interceptor

alt Create custom stage
  Recruiter -> UI: Add stage name
  UI -> Security: POST /api/v1/jobs/{jobId}/stages
  activate Security
  Security -> Interceptor: Forward after RBAC
  activate Interceptor
  deactivate Security
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
  Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: createCustom(jobId, name)
  activate Service
  Service -> TenantDB: INSERT RecruitmentStage system=false
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Created stage
  deactivate TenantDB
  Service --> Controller: StageResponse
  deactivate Service
  Controller --> UI: 201 Created
  deactivate Controller
  UI --> Recruiter: New column appears
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
  deactivate Interceptor

else Rename or reorder
  Recruiter -> UI: Rename stage or drag column order
  UI -> Security: PATCH stage or PUT /stages/order
  activate Security
  Security -> Interceptor: Forward after RBAC
  activate Interceptor
  deactivate Security
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
  Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: rename(...) or reorder(...)
  activate Service
  Service -> TenantDB: UPDATE name and/or sort_order
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Saved
  deactivate TenantDB
  Service --> Controller: StageResponse[*]
  deactivate Service
  Controller --> UI: 200 OK
  deactivate Controller
  UI --> Recruiter: Columns refreshed
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
  deactivate Interceptor

else Delete or archive stage
  Recruiter -> UI: Delete column
  UI -> Security: DELETE /api/v1/jobs/{jobId}/stages/{stageId}
  activate Security
  Security -> Interceptor: Forward after RBAC
  activate Interceptor
  deactivate Security
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
  Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: removeOrArchive(jobId, stageId)
  activate Service
  Service -> TenantDB: Load stage and count applications on it
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Stage and occupant count
  deactivate TenantDB

  alt System stage
    Service --> Controller: SYSTEM_STAGE_PROTECTED
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: 409 Conflict
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: System stages cannot be deleted
  else Stage has candidates
    Service -> TenantDB: SET archivedAt = now()
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Archived
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service --> Controller: Success archived
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: 200 OK
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Column hidden; cards stay until moved
  else Empty custom stage
    Service -> TenantDB: DELETE RecruitmentStage
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Removed
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service --> Controller: Success
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: 204 No Content
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Column removed
  end
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
  deactivate Interceptor
end

deactivate UI

note over TenantDB
  At least one non-archived first and last stage must remain.
  Hired and Rejected stay terminal system stages.
end note

@enduml
